---
import ServiceLayout from 'theme/layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';

const serviceData = {
  title: 'Long-Distance & UK-Wide Removals',
  slug: 'long-distance-removals',
  metaTitle: 'Long-Distance Removals London to UK | Pearl Removals',
  metaDescription: 'Direct, dedicated nationwide removals from North West London to anywhere in the UK. Dedicated vehicle, guaranteed delivery times & £50,000 GIT insurance.',
  heroHeading: 'Long-Distance Removals Across the United Kingdom',
  heroSubheading: 'Dedicated vehicle relocations from North West London to Scotland, Wales, the West Country, Midlands, and the North. Direct door-to-door transit without co-loading.',
  icon: 'compass',
  summary: 'Dedicated nationwide removal service ensuring your belongings travel exclusively in your own vehicle with guaranteed collection and delivery slots.',
  priceFrom: 550,
  priceUnit: 'move',
  priceNotes: 'Fixed written quotations based on exact mileage and home volume. Never shared with strangers\' loads; direct non-stop transit options available.',
  benefits: [
    'Dedicated removal vehicle exclusively assigned to your home move—no multi-drop delays or load mixing',
    'Guaranteed delivery windows so you are never left waiting on completion day at your new destination',
    'Direct transit from London along M1, M40, M4, M6, and A1(M) arterial corridors with real-time tracking',
    'Comprehensive £50,000 Goods in Transit insurance cover protecting your possessions nationwide',
    'Flexible collection times including weekend loading to coordinate smoothly with regional property chains',
    'Full packing and dismantling services available the day prior to departure for effortless long-distance travel'
  ],
  whatsIncluded: [
    'Fixed price quote covering all nationwide vehicle fuel, motorway tolls, and driver subsistence',
    'Sole-occupancy Luton or 7.5-tonne vehicle loaded and padlocked exclusively with your household goods',
    'Professional loading in London with heavy-duty quilted blankets, mattress covers, and securing ties',
    'Direct door-to-door transit with agreed arrival timeframe at your new regional property',
    'Full unloading and placement of furniture and cartons into nominated rooms at your destination',
    'Basic disassembly and reassembly of master beds and dining tables included as standard'
  ],
  whatsNotIncluded: [
    'Regional council parking suspension fees outside London (arranged via local receiving council if required)',
    'Ferry or toll bridge charges to offshore islands (e.g., Isle of Wight, Hebrides) unless itemised in quote',
    'Storage in transit fees if there is an unexpected multi-day delay in your destination property chain'
  ],
  process: [
    {
      step: 1,
      title: 'Survey & Route Logistics Plan',
      description: 'We calculate exact load cubic volume, plan optimal motorway routing avoiding known bottlenecks, and establish coordinated loading and delivery schedules.'
    },
    {
      step: 2,
      title: 'Departure Day Loading in London',
      description: 'Our crew systematically loads your home, wrapping every piece in heavy-duty transit blankets and securing everything to internal vehicle tracking rails.'
    },
    {
      step: 3,
      title: 'Dedicated Direct Transit',
      description: 'Your van drives directly to your destination city with zero detours to pick up other customers\' goods. You receive GPS progress updates throughout the journey.'
    },
    {
      step: 4,
      title: 'Arrival & Destination Placement',
      description: 'Upon key release at your new regional home, our crew unloads every item into your designated rooms, rebuilds furniture, and removes protective covers.'
    }
  ],
  premiumAngle: 'For executive relocations from prime London addresses to the Cotswolds, Cheshire, Edinburgh, or Cornwall, our VIP nationwide service includes dedicated two-driver teams, expedited same-day delivery, and full turnkey unpack.',
  faqs: [
    {
      question: 'Will my belongings be mixed in a van with another customer’s move?',
      answer: 'No. Unlike budget haulage or part-load freight operators who co-load multiple homes to cut costs, Pearl Removals assigns a dedicated vehicle exclusively to your move. Your possessions are loaded, locked, and driven straight to your new door.',
      display: true
    },
    {
      question: 'Can you load in London on a Friday and deliver to Scotland on a Monday?',
      answer: 'Yes. We frequently coordinate delayed weekend deliveries or overnight transits to align with solicitor completions, offering secure locked vehicle storage over the weekend.',
      display: true
    },
    {
      question: 'What happens if traffic causes delays on major motorways like the M1 or M6?',
      answer: 'Our drivers monitor live commercial satellite traffic data to bypass major motorway closures. We maintain direct communication with you throughout the journey, providing accurate ETA updates every two hours.',
      display: true
    },
    {
      question: 'How do you calculate the price for a nationwide move from London?',
      answer: 'Our quotes are completely transparent and fixed. We factor in property inventory volume (determining vehicle size and crew requirements), one-way road mileage, and any optional packing services. There are no surprise fuel surcharges.',
      display: true
    }
  ]
};
---

<ServiceLayout service={serviceData}>
  <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-navy dark:text-pearl tracking-tight">
      Direct, Punctual Nationwide Removals Originating from London
    </h2>
    <p>
      Relocating away from London to another region of the UK is an exciting chapter, whether you are moving to a period townhouse in Edinburgh, a rural retreat in the Cotswolds, a coastal family home in Devon, or relocating for business to Manchester or Leeds. However, managing a move across hundreds of miles introduces logistical challenges far greater than a local borough hop.
    </p>
    <p>
      At <strong>Pearl Removals</strong>, our strategic operations base in Cricklewood NW2 gives us immediate access to major outbound transport arteries: the M1 (Junction 1 at Staples Corner), the A406 North Circular, the A41, and direct links to the M4, M40, and M25. We provide dedicated, non-stop nationwide removal services designed around your exact schedule.
    </p>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy dark:text-pearl pt-4">
      The Dedicated Vehicle Difference: No Shared Loads, No Delays
    </h3>
    <p>
      Many removals companies operate long-distance journeys on a "groupage" or "part-load" basis. Under this model, your cherished possessions are mixed inside an articulated lorry with loads belonging to other families, and delivery can take anywhere from three days to two weeks while the driver makes scattered stops across the country.
    </p>
    <p>
      Pearl Removals operates on a strictly dedicated basis. When you book a nationwide move with us, the vehicle assigned to your property belongs solely to you. Your belongings are loaded in London, padlocked, and transported directly to your destination. This guarantees total security, zero risk of mixed-up cartons, and precise arrival timings that coordinate seamlessly with your key exchange.
    </p>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy dark:text-pearl pt-4">
      Long-Haul Road Protection & Load Engineering
    </h3>
    <p>
      A vehicle travelling 200 to 400 miles over British motorways and country A-roads experiences sustained vibrations, centrifugal force around roundabouts, and sudden decelerations. Sub-standard loading that might survive a two-mile local move will fail during an inter-city journey.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our experienced loaders pack with interlocking precision. Every hollow space is filled, heavy timber furniture is anchored with commercial ratchet webbings to load rails, and mattresses act as shock-absorbing dividers between sensitive timber pieces. All upholstered furniture travels in waterproof, heavy-duty padded covers to protect against exhaust grime and motorway moisture.
    </p>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy dark:text-pearl pt-4">
      Comprehensive Insurance & Clear Communication
    </h3>
    <p>
      Every long-distance contract includes £50,000 Goods in Transit insurance as standard, with options to declare higher valuations for fine art, antiques, or luxury designer furnishings. Throughout your moving day, your dedicated move coordinator remains your single point of contact, ensuring you receive timely arrival estimates as your driver progresses smoothly toward your new regional home.
    </p>
  </div>
</ServiceLayout>
